          "quote": "尋出為（宣）〔宜〕州刺史。卒於位，時年六十四。子鼒嗣。",
          "person_mention_id": "c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538:p013:m0249",
          "context": {
            "kind": "prior_paragraph_subject",
